  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK ISAR Response to Support Mozambique Floods</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This component helps provide life-saving support as Mozambique faces severe flooding. It boosts the response with fast operational and technical capacity through UK support, helping reach affected communities quickly and backing up national efforts on the ground. It strengthens the wider humanitarian response and forms part of the Mozambique Humanitarian Rapid Response Programme.</narrative>
  </description>
